# Arya Agent — Plugin Integration Environment Variables
#
# Runtime configuration (LLM endpoint, model, ports, timeouts, etc.) lives in
# `~/.config/arya/config.json`. This file is reserved for plugin integrations
# only. Copy to `.env` (or `~/.config/arya/.env`) and fill in your values.
#
# Plugins are loaded dynamically from `~/.config/arya/plugins/*.ts`. Each
# plugin defines which environment variables it consumes — refer to the
# plugin's own documentation. Plugins are NOT shipped in this repo.
